          "law school"
        ],
        "releaseNotes": "\u2022 You can now subscribe from inside the app to unlock case digests, past bar exams, study tools, and camera scan-to-digest.\n\u2022 Already subscribed? Restore Purchases brings your subscription back on a new device or after reinstalling.\n\u2022 Terms of Use and our Privacy Policy are now readable in the app, on the same screen.\n\u2022 Stability and navigation fixes throughout.",
        "promoText": "Plain-language Philippine case digests, codals, and 1,500+ bar exam questions — built for Filipino law students and lawyers.",
        "marketingUrl": "https://libertasian.com",
        "supportUrl": "https://libertasian.com/contact",
        "privacyPolicyUrl": "https://libertasian.com/privacy"
      }
